{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#973","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#973","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#973\",\"parent_revision\":\"fd53fd7362ffe7be164fc4ef2c3cf4b70b0a58c5\",\"root_revision\":\"fb6ba8f5b474a30798e0e24a6ec2207f6887ef6dc17a901e617a07d1c7199e83\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nArchitect and task planner agents designing workflow skills do not load the orchestrator discipline rules or agent-orchestration delegation guidelines. This caused the work-milestone SKILL.md to encode a pre-decomposition anti-pattern where the orchestrator pre-gathers data (backlog_view, sam_read, skill aggregation) that the worktree agent can and should discover itself.\\n\\nRoot cause: agents spawned as plugin-creator:contextual-ai-documentation-optimizer with only plugin-creator skills loaded. They had no access to:\\n- .claude/CLAUDE.md Context Window Discipline section\\n- .claude/rules/source-fidelity.md State-Before-Execute scope\\n- plugins/orchestrator-discipline/ plugin\\n- agent-orchestration:agent-orchestration skill (delegation template, pre-gathering prohibition)\\n\\nProcess gap: no quality gate checks skill/agent content against orchestrator discipline rules. The plan-validator checks DAG validity and AC coverage but not whether designed workflows violate delegation constraints.\\n\\nSuggested fix: either (a) add orchestrator-discipline as a required skill for agents writing workflow SKILL.md files, or (b) add an orchestrator-discipline compliance check to the plan-validator or code-reviewer agent when reviewing workflow skill content.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **architect and planner agents lack orchestrator discipline rules when designing workflow skills** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session 2026-03-21: discovered during work-milestone audit\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-21\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-02)\\n\\n### Priority\\n\\n7/10 \u2014 Directly causes anti-patterns to be encoded into workflow skills that then propagate into every session using those skills. A single bad SKILL.md produced by a non-disciplined agent multiplies into every orchestrator that loads that skill.\\n\\n### Impact\\n\\n- Blocks: Any workflow skill authored or revised by architect/planner agents will embed delegation anti-patterns (pre-gathering, investigation escalation) that are then enforced on every orchestrator loading that skill.\\n- Bottleneck: The work-milestone SKILL.md incident is a confirmed instance; any future skill authoring session using contextual-ai-documentation-optimizer, swarm-task-planner, or python-cli-design-spec without orchestrator-discipline loaded will repeat the pattern.\\n\\n### Benefits\\n\\n- Architect and planner agents will produce SKILL.md workflow sections that follow delegation discipline rather than encoding orchestrator-does-all-discovery patterns.\\n- plan-validator gains a new check dimension: delegation constraint compliance, preventing regressions at the quality gate layer.\\n\\n### Expected Behavior\\n\\nWhen an agent producing or revising a workflow SKILL.md has the orchestrator-discipline skill loaded, the resulting workflow steps instruct orchestrators to pass file paths to sub-agents rather than pre-gathering and summarizing data. The `agent-orchestration` skill's pre-gathering prohibition and the `orchestrator-discipline` skill's investigation escalation anti-pattern are available to the agent as authoring constraints, not just runtime hooks.\\n\\n### Desired Structure\\n\\n- The following agents have `orchestrator-discipline` and/or `agent-orchestration` added to their `skills:` frontmatter field:\\n  - `plugins/plugin-creator/agents/contextual-ai-documentation-optimizer.md` (confirmed agent for workflow SKILL.md authoring)\\n  - `plugins/development-harness/agents/swarm-task-planner.md` (produces task plans that include orchestrator instructions)\\n  - `plugins/development-harness/agents/feature-researcher.md` (produces feature-context docs referenced in workflow)\\n  - `plugins/development-harness/agents/plan-validator.md` (validates plans; needs a new validation dimension for delegation constraint compliance)\\n  - `plugins/python-engineering/agents/python-cli-design-spec.md` (produces architecture specs referenced by swarm-task-planner)\\n  - `plugins/python3-development/agents/python-cli-design-spec.md` (duplicate plugin copy \u2014 same fix)\\n- The plan-validator agent gains a Dimension 7: Delegation Constraint Compliance check that flags workflow step descriptions encoding orchestrator pre-gathering or investigation escalation.\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n1. Running `grep -r 'orchestrator-discipline\\\\|agent-orchestration' plugins/plugin-creator/agents/contextual-ai-documentation-optimizer.md` returns at least one match in the `skills:` field.\\n2. Running `grep -r 'orchestrator-discipline\\\\|agent-orchestration' plugins/development-harness/agents/swarm-task-planner.md` returns at least one match in the `skills:` field.\\n3. Running `uvx skilllint@latest check plugins/plugin-creator/agents/contextual-ai-documentation-optimizer.md` exits 0 after the skills field is updated.\\n4. Running `uvx skilllint@latest check plugins/development-harness/agents/swarm-task-planner.md` exits 0 after the skills field is updated.\\n5. `plugins/development-harness/agents/plan-validator.md` contains a Dimension 7 section describing delegation constraint compliance checks (e.g., flags workflow steps that pre-gather data or run diagnostics on behalf of sub-agents).\\n6. `uvx skilllint@latest check plugins/development-harness/agents/plan-validator.md` exits 0 after update.\\n7. `uvx skilllint@latest check plugins/python-engineering/agents/python-cli-design-spec.md` exits 0 after the skills field is updated with orchestrator-discipline or agent-orchestration.\\n\\n### Resources\\n\\n| Type | Item |\\n|------|------|\\n| Plugin | plugins/orchestrator-discipline/ \u2014 rules/CLAUDE.md and skills/orchestrator-discipline/SKILL.md |\\n| Skill | agent-orchestration:agent-orchestration \u2014 pre-gathering prohibition and delegation template |\\n| Skill | agent-orchestration:how-to-delegate \u2014 delegation worksheet |\\n| Agent | plugins/plugin-creator/agents/contextual-ai-documentation-optimizer.md \u2014 primary affected agent |\\n| Agent | plugins/development-harness/agents/swarm-task-planner.md \u2014 affected agent (skills: field already used for clear-cove-task-design) |\\n| Agent | plugins/development-harness/agents/plan-validator.md \u2014 candidate for new validation dimension |\\n| Agent | plugins/development-harness/agents/feature-researcher.md \u2014 affected agent |\\n| Agent | plugins/python-engineering/agents/python-cli-design-spec.md \u2014 affected agent |\\n| Agent | plugins/python3-development/agents/python-cli-design-spec.md \u2014 duplicate plugin copy |\\n| Prior work | plugins/development-harness/docs/sdlc-layers/layer-0/orchestrator-discipline.md \u2014 existing SDLC reference |\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n\\n- Depends on: None \u2014 orchestrator-discipline plugin and agent-orchestration skill already exist\\n- Blocks: None identified\\n\\n### Blockers\\n\\nNone \u2014 all required resources exist. The orchestrator-discipline plugin is installed and its skills are available. The agent-orchestration plugin and its skills are present at plugins/agent-orchestration/.\\n\\n### Effort\\n\\nSmall \u2014 changes are confined to frontmatter `skills:` field additions in 5-6 agent files plus a prose addition to plan-validator. No new code, no new skills, no schema changes. Validation via skilllint after each edit.\\n\",\"digest\":\"c9ef6f5a29b1072849c571825b368abe5195c28a0337e68342a06315e8ec55c3\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPnOaRg\"}"}